[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43561596/2e0e0cd339a6f6d18f2da1c0d2733aba02aae6cd.png[/img]
[h3]Optimization[/h3]
[list]
[*] Game quests are now categorized into [Main Objectives] and [Secondary Objectives] for clearer main storyline progression;
[*] Some of ICEY's hidden achievements are now non-hidden, allowing to track the unlock progress;
[*] Added Chinese voice-over for Reki's combat when the combat voice is set as Exclamation;
[*] Added the function to switch the voice-over language for Prototype selection;
[*] Added a [View Achievements] option to NPC Rock;
[*] Reduced the hitbox of ICEY's Potential [Integration] during sheathing to better match the animation;
[*] Optimized the description of the dodge effect in ICEY's Potential [Pummel] enhancement.
[*] Adjusted Noel's damage calculation formula;
[*] Added a hidden achievement related to ICEY;
[*] The camera distance in Potential Trial and Evotype Trial space will now be consistent with the Combat Camera Distance;
[/list]

[h3]Bug Fixes[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed an issue where the Event Space might not display properly;
[*] Fixed an issue where Hazama's second Legacy would trigger the cooldown effect multiple times upon hit;
[*] Fixed an issue where Jin's Potential [Hirensou] might not be able to charge and use in some cases;
[*] Fixed an issue where Jin's subsequent skills might not release correctly after releasing Legacy.
[*] Fixed an issue where Jin's MP cost was incorrect when using certain moves;
[*] Fixed an issue where the duration of the buff applied when Mai threw her javelin may not match the animation;
[*] Fixed an issue where the dodge effect in ICEY's Potential [Deadly Disc]'s hidden effect was not working properly;
[*] Fixed an issue where ICEY's Potential [Deadly Disc] would loop infinitely under certain circumstances;
[*] Fixed an issue where the shockwave released by ICEY's Potential [Surge] was not displaying correctly;
[*] Fixed an issue where ICEY's Potentials [Overload] and [Divide] could be interrupted incorrectly;
[*] Fixed some abnormal performance issues with Reki during combat;
[*] Fixed an issue where the hidden achievement of Floating Mind was not triggering properly;
[*] Fixed an issue where the Defiling Eye in Mind Trial could move below the ground;
[*] Fixed issues with getting stuck and abnormal portal generation in some levels of Sakura City;
[*] Fixed some other issues;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43561596/2e0e0cd339a6f6d18f2da1c0d2733aba02aae6cd.png[/img]
[h3]Optimization[/h3]
[list]
[*] After completing the ICEY crossover levels for the first time, you can reset the progress to 0% data recovery progress when repeatedly challenging the ICEY crossover levels, and you can reset the progress of the current level by exiting and re-entering during the game in any level;
[*] The new Legacy skills unlock method has been changed to unlocking new Legacy skills for all Evotypes of the same Prototype after using any Evotype to pass the Mind Trial (Boss Rush);
[*] Fixed an issue where it might not be possible to enter the hidden area of the ICEY crossover map when running the game on low to medium graphics settings;
[*] Reduced the difficulty of running maps in the ICEY crossover and added save points;
[*] Fixed some issues with abnormal display of special effects;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43561596/2e0e0cd339a6f6d18f2da1c0d2733aba02aae6cd.png[/img]
[h3]Optimization[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed an issue where the wrong background music might play during Mind Training stages;
[*] Fixed an issue where players could not receive calls after inheriting save data, resulting in Phenomena system errors;
[*] [Tactic Ascension] in the Exchange Space can now directly increase the selected Tactic's level by 2, with a corresponding price increase;
[*] Fixed an issue where using the command [↓+ Jump] after some characters jumped could trigger both a fast fall and a double jump;
[*] Fixed an issue where the impact effect of a certain extended move of Ragna's Potential [Purgatory Rising Fist] was delayed or did not trigger when hitting enemies.
[*] Adjusted the trigger timing of Jin's Potential [Rengoku Hyouya] to reduce the chance of accidental releases;
[*] Adjusted the priority of Jin's Potentials [Hiyoku Getsumei] and [Kokuujin: Yukikaze] during the continuous release of the Potential [Touga Hyoujin];
[*] Fixed an issue where the enhancement [Hirensou] of Jin's Potential [Fubuki /Sekkajin] would be incorrectly hit in certain situations;
[*] Adjusted the ice arrow collision detection of Jin's Potential [Hiyoku Getsumei] to reduce instances of getting stuck in walls and ceilings when close to them;
[*] Fixed an issue where Λ-No.11- Potential [Legacy Edge] could not overdraft MP;
[*] Fixed an issue where Es Potential [Type:Slasher "Galahad"] dealt abnormal damage when triggered;
[*] Increased the interrupt priority of Es Potential [Type:Slasher "Gawain"] in some actions;
[*] Optimized the combo effect of Es Potential [Type:Assaulter "Tristan"], the effect of trampling landing is further enhanced, and the invincible effect of trampling in the combo also takes effect briefly after hitting and bouncing;
[*] Fixed an issue where Hakumen's second Attack was not being correctly buffed by Potential;
[*] Fixed an issue where Hakumen's shockwaves could not pass through certain scene components correctly;
[*] Fixed an issue where the visual effect of Hakumen's Airborne Attack was displayed abnormally;
[*] Fixed an issue where Hibiki could not dodge immediately after landing when using the command [↓+Attack] in the air after obtaining the Potential [Shadow Heel];
[*] Fixed an issue where the level would be softlocked when Taokaka quickly entering the second floor of Floating Mind;
[*] Fixed an issue where Taokaka's Potential [Falling Cat!] could not jump properly when released on certain terrain;
[*] Fixed an issue where Taokaka's Potential [Falling Cat!] would incorrectly inherit the speed of the previous action;
[*] Optimized the release mechanism of Taokaka's Airborne Attack;
[*] Fixed an issue where the shadow of the elite enemy Serpent of Destruction could attack from off-screen;
[*] Fixed an issue where the elite enemy Floating Mind could experience an abnormal phase transition when defeated in the first phase;
[*] Fixed an issue where the position of the elite enemy Floating Mind could be incorrect when splitting;
[*] Fixed an issue where the center of the elite enemy Floating Mind could have abnormal attack determination;
[*] Fixed an issue where some attacks of the elite enemy Tree of Origin did not have a warning;
[*] Fixed an issue where the floor electricity in the battle area of the elite enemy NAN-01 disappeared abnormally;
[*] Optimized the AI performance of some standard enemies;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43561596/2e0e0cd339a6f6d18f2da1c0d2733aba02aae6cd.png[/img]
[h3]Optimization[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed an issue where it was not possible to enter the next space in certain circumstances;
[*] Fixed an issue where debuffs would reactivate once when clearing certain debuffs in the Exchange Space;
[*] Fixed an issue where some Phenomena related achievements could not be completed;
[*] Fixed an issue where the Steam achievement [Final Victory] could not be completed;
[*] Fixed an issue where the Mind Crystal [Curse to Boon] was not taking effect properly;
[*] Fixed a potential UI display anomaly on the settlement interface;
