[*] Fixed an issue where keyboard input could become unresponsive after settlement in Solo Mode;
[*] Fixed an issue where Gold and Double Tactic might not be obtainable on Normal difficulty;
[*] Fixed an issue where HP Mixture was not correctly affected by Mind Crystal [Mixture Enhancement] when used outside of combat;
[*] Fixed an issue where Mind Crystal [Perennial] did not take effect in two-player mode;
[*] Fixed an issue where Mind Crystal [Take Initiative] did not take effect when the buff [Skill Damage Increased] was active;
[*] Fixed an issue where Taokaka's Potential [Falling Cat!] could glide infinitely under certain circumstances;
