Hey everyone,

A hot fix patch was just installed to improve the performance after last regular update:

[h3]Optimization[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed an issue where Es's battle voice lines were playing abnormally;
[*] Fixed an issue where Es's Potential [Type:Assaulter "Tristan"] hidden effect could be prematurely used again, and the range of the Crest released when landing is abnormal;
[*] Fixed an issue where Ragna's Potential [Black Onslaught] consumed extra SP when hit and could also recover SP;
[*] Fixed an issue where Jin's move [Touga Hyoujin] could not continuously trigger the sheathing in the air under certain circumstances;
[*] Fixed an issue where Taokaka could not perform a triple jump normally;
[*] Fixed an issue where Taokaka's Potential [Attack Meow Pow!] sometimes did not spawn an extra clone when it ended;
